<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18166" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not uttered</i> or
				<i>named, nameless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρες ὁμῶς ἄ. τε φατοί τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unutterable, ineffable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					782
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. μέλεα</span>”
				<i>monstrous,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					1.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.112
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Pers.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. χρήματα</span>
			<i>untold</i> sums, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.190
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. νέφος, κτύπος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1314
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				1464
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνιθαρίων
			ἄφατον</span> (Schw. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-των</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> πλῆθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxandr.
					41.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώλων ἄφατον τάχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2012.4
				</span></i>
			 (Sulp. <i><span class="en">
				Max.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					3.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβολὴ δυνάμεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Inv.</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					4.8.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφατον ὡς</span> . . <i>there's
				no saying</i> how . . , i.e. <i>marvellously, immensely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				428
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				198
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
